Zlib: gzip and deflate files and output compression, with the zlib of
the base system.

The module zlib of PHP 8.2 for php82 of azsupport/ports, which installs
side by side with the other versions of PHP: lib/php/20220829/zlib.so,
loaded by its ini in etc/php82/conf.d, its headers in
include/php82/php/ext/zlib.
